  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.4.0 migrates the entire repository test suite to MSTest 4.5.1 on native Microsoft.Testing.Platform.\nPreserves every existing test case and the unchanged coverlet.MTP measurement contract, with native assertions, data providers, resource locks, cancellation, and per-test fixtures.\nRemoves the previous test framework and updates all test commands and documentation. Published APIs, coverage gates, exit codes, and JSON contracts are unchanged.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.4.0.md",
